*** Awarded in {p:Colonization Reives|Colonization Reive} in {z:Kamihr Drifts} (Requires {@k} {k:"Fragmenting"} from Quest: {q:Breaking the Ice|Breaking the Ice|Breaking the Ice}) (**{p:U|Uncommon (10%)}**).
*** Awarded in {p:Colonization Reives|Colonization Reive} in {z:Outer Ra'Kaznar} (Requires {@k} {k:"Pulverizing"} from Quest: {q:Lerene's Lament|Lerene's Lament|Lerene's Lament}) (**{p:C|Common (15%)}**).
*** Gathered in {p:Mog Gardens} (Requires {p:Mineral Vein} Rank 3).
** {i:Soil Gem|Soil Gem|3319}
*** Crafted from {p:Goldsmithing}.
** {i:Soil Geode|Soil Geode|3300} x12.
* You may find {p:Unity} Warp 125 to {z:Quicksand Caves} helpful to reach the {z:Cloister of Tremors} containing the {i:Tremorstone|Tremorstone|2796} in the west part of the caves. Alternatively, you can use {p:Home Point #2 (Kuzotz -> Quicksand Caves)|Home Point} to be placed just outside the Cloister.
* Trade him the items at the same time to receive your reward.
** The {@k} {k:Loadstone} will allow you to open the weighted doors in {z:Quicksand Caves} solo.

